Image flow:
1. POST /api/v1/sessions with Shopify identifiers and consent_given=true.
2. POST /api/v1/image-validation with the returned session_id and image.
3. When valid, the API returns image_id and next_step="questionnaire"; route the
   customer to the questionnaire immediately. Image analysis runs as a background task.
4. Poll GET /api/v1/sessions/{session_id}/analysis for pending, completed, or failed
   status. Completed responses include primary_concerns.

POST /api/v1/image-analysis is a deprecated async alias for image upload. New clients
should use /api/v1/image-validation.

Add background workers as services for production instead of asyncio worker - test shopify's timeout sensitivity 
Make sure images are uploaded only once from shopify frontend . Will be accessed by the backend workers via reference token from the storage.
